{"id":"715949688","kind":"article","title":"序列 vs 常青笔记","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/The_Sequences_vs_evergreen_notes"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2024-08-23","updated":"2024-08-23","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":414,"keywords":["常青笔记","LessWrong","知识管理","维基链接"],"summary":"文章比较 LessWrong 的“序列”与 Andy Matuschak 的常青笔记：二者都用自创术语、原子化笔记和维基链接组织思想；但前者本身是系统阐述的成果，后者更像持续修订、供后续写作使用的知识底座，篇幅也更短。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/715949688","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"YcifSMCW\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Eliezer_Yudkowsky&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Eliezer Yudkowsky</a> 在 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=LessWrong&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LessWrong</a> 连载的「序列」与 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Andy_Matuschak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Andy Matuschak</a> 的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Evergreen_notes&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>有诸多相似之处。</p><ul><li data-pid=\"TgclJ8nr\"> 他们试图给概念贴上标签，并不害怕创造新的术语，以便使后续的思考更加清晰<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"KMN_kORH\"> 他们将原子化的洞见打包成笔记或博客文章，以便在作品的其他地方引用。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"aPkKIiPf\"> 他们广泛使用维基式链接，这样读者就可以探索前置知识和相关思想<br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"VQmA--_y\">几点显著差异：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"AK-T_6jO\"> Andy 似乎并不将常青笔记视为最终成果，而是将其作为撰写论文等公开作品时的知识底座。相比之下，Eliezer 眼中的序列本身即是主要交付物。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"qhVcp0wG\"> 常青笔记往往处于不断修订的状态，而序列的写就则是为了系统阐述 Eliezer 业已形成的连贯思想。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"jsBdh78D\"> 常青笔记篇幅通常远比序列文章精简。<br/> </li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"TV_kZYEi\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 claude-3-opus，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/The_Sequences_vs_evergreen_notes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The Sequences vs evergreen notes</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 常青笔记（Evergreen notes） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"416319260\" href=\"#/post/416319260\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"715765481","title":"面向数学的《时空幻境》","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"716147393","title":"间隔重复与记忆无关","author":"Issa Rice","votes":30,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"416319260","title":"常青笔记（Evergreen notes）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":188,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"443475039","title":"反向链接可以用来隐式定义知识管理系统中的节点","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":14,"minutes":2,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「知识管理」· Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}